## Versions
@solana/web3.js v1.x (from app dependencies)

## Core Principles
Use PublicKey from @solana/web3.js, never cast directly (validate through PublicKey constructor), use PublicKey.isOnCurve(), use @repo/utils/web3 for chain utilities

## Address Handling
new PublicKey(address) in try/catch, PublicKey.isOnCurve(publicKey) for validation

## Transaction Handling
Create transaction: new Transaction().add(SystemProgram.transfer({ fromPubkey, toPubkey, lamports }))

## Performance
Reuse PublicKey instances, validate addresses early

